   "date": "2019-02-20",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Water Amendment (Indigenous Authority Member) Bill 2019 creates a standing Indigenous authority member position on the Murray‑Darling Basin Authority, to be appointed based on expertise in Indigenous water matters. The government also committed $40 million over four years for Indigenous water entitlements and $30 million for the Wilcannia Weir upgrade."
